+/*
+ * File Explorer: what the details pane says about pictures and videos
+ * (Stained Glass OS)
+ *
+ * A picture's dimensions and bit depth from WIC; a video's length and frame
+ * size from Media Foundation's source reader (winegstreamer underneath).
+ * Our own work from the documented interfaces; no Microsoft code.
+ *
